WEBVTT

00:11:57.076 --> 00:12:01.796
when they basically take responsibility
for fixing the business model,

00:12:01.836 --> 00:12:05.076
what's going to happen
is a lot of entrepreneurs

00:12:05.116 --> 00:12:07.076
are going to come into the space,

00:12:07.116 --> 00:12:09.476
and the market is going
to become efficient.

00:12:09.516 --> 00:12:11.916
So this needs to happen.

00:12:12.236 --> 00:12:18.796
So I think it's very important
for moms, women, allies,

00:12:18.836 --> 00:12:21.396
everybody to come in and say,

00:12:21.436 --> 00:12:23.156
"What are your childcare benefits?"

00:12:23.156 --> 00:12:25.916
We have a study coming out
which will show, with McKinsey,

00:12:25.916 --> 00:12:27.196
probably next week,

00:12:27.196 --> 00:12:30.636
which will basically prove the case